Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 22:56:16 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] spectro: bump containerized-data-importer-api to v1.66.1

v1.66.0 adds DataVolumeSourceHTTP.InsecureSkipVerify, which the Nutanix
importer needs. The module only requires k8s.io/api and apimachinery
v0.31.5, below ours, so nothing else moves.

Resolves: None

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
